<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Endesa H1 earnings, full breakdown.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Endesa H1 earnings, full breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A breakdown of first half results for Spanish electricity group Endesa (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Attributable profit		 78.59	vs    81.77</p>
<p> Pretax profit			119.98	vs   121.45</p>
<p> Net taxed			     86.26	vs    86.27</p>
<p> Turnover (net)		     604.65	vs   413.27</p>
<p> Net operating profit	     158.06	vs   143.01</p>
<p> Ordinary profit		    117.22	vs   134.21</p>
<p> Fin income			     4.28	vs     4.05</p>
<p> Fin costs			     50.99	vs    27.61</p>
<p> Amortisation, provisions	   1.71	vs     1.28</p>
<p> Goodwill depreciation		0.74	vs     0.42</p>
<p> Extraordinary profit		 2.24	vs    15.19 loss</p>
<p> Other revenues			16.26	vs    10.02</p>
<p> Total production value	   620.91	vs   423.29</p>
<p> Net purchases			199.09	vs   137.17</p>
<p> External and oper expenses	52.87	vs    30.82</p>
<p> Adjusted value added	     362.73	vs   263.76</p>
<p> Personnel costs		     92.22	vs    62.06</p>
<p> Gross operating profit	   270.51	vs   201.70</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are consolidated.</p>
</text>
